' The editors of Vibe Commander: the editor of your own that F4
' runs for a file by its extension, in place of the built-in one.
' A line such as
'
'   c: ne !.!
'
' names one. Alt-F4 always uses the built-in editor.
'
' A web page cannot run commands, so this file names no editor, and
' F4 uses the built-in one for every file.
